herdr tab create --workspace "$HERDR_WORKSPACE_ID" --cwd ‹scratch›/brainstorm/prod-codex --label prod-codex --no-focus
herdr tab create --workspace "$HERDR_WORKSPACE_ID" --cwd ‹scratch›/brainstorm/prod-fable --label prod-fable --no-focus
herdr agent start prod-codex --kind codex --pane ‹pane› --timeout 120000 -- -m gpt-6-astra -c model_reasoning_effort=xhigh -s workspace-write -a never --search
herdr agent start prod-fable --kind claude --pane ‹pane› --timeout 120000 -- --model claude-fable-5-1 --effort xhigh --name prod-fable
```
I answer `prod-fable`'s permission prompts myself: writes inside its folder only, default deny.

**4. Round 1** (Write two brief files; two Bash calls, **background**)
